.TH SOVEREIGN-GRPC 7 "May 2026" "v2.0" "Sovereign Mesh Manual"
.SH NAME
sovereign-grpc \- Remote execution and swarm synchronization API
.SH DESCRIPTION
The **Sovereign gRPC** plane (Port 1111) governs bidirectional remote execution, pedigree traversal, and majority-based state mutations across the mesh.
.SH SERVICE SPECIFICATIONS
The \fBsync.proto\fR schema defines the following core RPC endpoints:
.TP
\fBPing\fR
Verifies node connectivity and calculates network latency.
.TP
\fBTracePedigree\fR
Traverses the 7-layer relational ancestry of an active agent.
.TP
\fBProposeSwarmMutation\fR
Submits a state change for 4/5 majority consensus evaluation.
.TP
\fBQuerySwarmLedger\fR
Performs cryptographic audits on the blockchain ledger.
.TP
\fBTimeTravelOverride\fR
Invokes the **JetWeb** engine for retroactive timeline refactoring.
.SH RESILIENCE & FAILOVER
To ensure operational survival, the execution dialer implements an automatic \fBSSH Fallback\fR. If Port 1111 is unreachable or times out, the system automatically triggers a POSIX SSH pipe to Port 22 to maintain terminal supervision.
.SH FILES
.TP
\fIproto/sync.proto\fR
The foundational Protobuf schema for the gRPC plane.
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBsovereign-cli\fR(1), \fBmgsh-cli\fR(1), \fBstarbirth\fR(7)
